  {
    "number": 62,
    "title": "Record dashboard physical acceptance and cadence decision",
    "body": "Records the four authorized Pixoo64 dashboard runs, including the cancelled write that visibly applied and the separately authorized successful restart. Selects complete RGB frames and a configurable 1000 ms minimum submission interval for downstream #33 integration, with bounded sample and clock uncertainty stated explicitly.\n\nRefs #30. Source tooling was delivered in #59. This documentation-only update changes no executable contract; no new OpenSpec delta applies. The qualification CLI retains its historical 3000 ms fallback, and reproduction passes 1000 ms explicitly.\n\nValidation: manual recording/receipt comparison for both cadences, cancellation and restart; owner-confirmed readability; documentation diff and relative-link inspection; `git diff --check`. All five current PR and merged-main CI jobs and independent Standards/Specification review remain required. Original videos, device identity and runtime receipts stay outside Git. No installation or further device operation is included.\n\nThe coordinator owns the linked Hub guide companion; guide synchronization is pending until its reviewed acceptance/status reconciliation merges. Public guide publication is outside this delivery.\n",
    "state": "open",
